          "text": "According to Ms. Kovner (Petitioner), according to Ms. Kovner (Petitioner), the petitioner argues that the agency\u2019s rule defining unsolicited advertisement should be followed by the Court, and if the Court declines to follow it, it must provide a reason."
        },
